<td><span style="font-size:125%;"><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-001</span></td>
<td style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-size:125%;"><span style="color: #990000"><strong>Level 5/001</strong></span></span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span style="font-size:125%;"><strong>Object Class:</strong> Atelis</span></td>
<td style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-size:125%;"><span style="color: #990000"><strong>Classified</strong></span></span></td>
